---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro'
import Listing from '../components/mdPostListing.astro'
const allPosts = await Astro.glob('./blog/*.md');
---
<style>
ul {
	list-style: none;
	padding: 0;
	margin: 0 0 0 2ch;
}
</style>
<Layout title="blog" description="i attempt to write a blog without having anything to talk about">
	<h1>Notes</h1>
	<p>Tbh I don't think I'm qualified to write any kind of blog, but it seems every fucking website I look at has one, so why not, maybe one day I'll think of something to put here.</p>
	<h1>Posts</h1>
	<ul>
	{allPosts.map((post) => <Listing post={post} />)}
	</ul>
</Layout>
